          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<html>\n<head>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <h1>Haiku: Interconnection</h1>\n  \n  <p>Scrolling through my phone.\n  \n  The internet connects us.\n  \n  For better or worse.</p>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
